      "side": 1,
      "message": "This patch itself LGTM, but just wondering: since this patch alone is not enough anyway (since load_unaligned_zeropad() may also access memory donated to a pVM or to pKVM, not just memory reserved for pKVM), and since the next patch aosp/4047494 covers all kinds of pKVM-protected memory and thus makes this patch redundant, do we need this patch?",
